<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Notation</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide a comprehensive reference of symbols and definitions used throughout the paper, categorized by their functional domains.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Symbol</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS1.p2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" colspan="2"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Entities</span></td></tr>
